    "public_key_hex": "2152f8d19b791d24453242e15f2eab6cb7cffa7b6a5ed30097960e069881db12",
    "did_key": "did:key:z6MkghLt1e8m1fmANsdJJco3aCLV8Xnigr5UWwC3u5iZFPd3"
  },
  "notes": "receipt_key_fingerprints pins the rcpt-001 registry test key (seed 0x11 x 32, fingerprint sha256:10ba682c8ad13513971e8b56881aab8bd702bb807796eca81932c735a94d6e6d). A5 and B6 use the sig-001 key fingerprint as an unpinned registry key. A8 is defence in depth: schema-valid bodies are already lowercase (§4.3).",
